The encoded observation is the SpaceX DSCOVR/Falcon 9 launch photograph,
released into the public domain according to the scikit-image data.rocket
documentation. Original JPEG coefficient integers and quantization tables are
preserved without recompression. No endorsement by SpaceX is implied.

No Ooura DCT source is distributed here. The cleaned implementation uses
general SciPy orthonormal DCT primitives, and their arithmetic differences
from the upstream float32 Ooura implementation are explicitly validated.
